[{"title":"念奴娇 其五 和徐尉游石湖","author":"陈三聘","text":"扁舟此计，问当年、谁与寻盟鸥鸟。\n许国勋名彝鼎在，风月不妨吟笑。\n碧草台边，红云溪上，寿杖扶诗老。\n水浮天处，未应俗驾曾到。\n盛事埒美知章，鉴湖君赐，宸翰今题号。\n指点飞烟轻霭外，有路直通仙岛。\n蓑笠渔船，琴书客坐，清夜尊罍倒。\n未须归去，片蟾初上林表。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"馀霞飞绮，望长天、顷刻云容凝碧。\n今夕江皋风力软，明日波心头白。\n客舸东流，语离深夜，遣我新愁积。\n春融花丽，定知天相行色。\n别后一纸乡书，故人相问，好趁秋鸿翼。\n空有佳人千点泪，锦字机中曾织。\n利锁名缰，古今同是，谁失知谁得。\n来朝愁望，旧楼何处西北。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"水空高下，望沈沈一色，浑然苍碧。\n天籁不鸣凉有露，金气横秋寂寂。\n玉宇琼楼，望中何处，月到天中极。\n御风归去，不愁衣袂无力。\n此夜飘泊孤篷，短歌谁和，自笑狂踪迹。\n咫尺蓝桥仙路远，窅窅云英消息。\n疏影婆娑，恍然身世，我是尊前客。\n一声凄怨，倚楼谁弄长笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"白首故人重会面，论交尔汝忘形。\n从今心迹喜双清。\n飞鸿追往事，为蝶笑馀生。\n琥珀杯浓春正好，此怀端为君倾。\n旧时猿鹤敢寒盟。\n鸠居从拙计，鹏翼任高程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"夜饮只愁更漏促，留连笑罥蔷薇。\n歌声缭绕彻帘帏。\n坐中清泪落，梁上暗尘飞。\n重睹舞腰惊束素，不应更褪罗衣。\n别来容易见来稀。\n次公狂已甚，不醉亦忘归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南柯子/南歌子 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"别后惊人远，归心怯橹柔。\n晚天凉思冷于秋。\n冷浸一溪明月、水弥流。\n醉里狂仍在，吟馀趣极幽。\n夜深何用数更筹。\n别有好风吹酒、不须求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南柯子/南歌子 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"烟树观前浦，风苹听远洲。\n等闲来上水边楼。\n怅望天涯、何处有归舟。\n香断灯花夜，歌停扇影秋。\n欲缄尺素说离愁。\n不见双鱼、空有大江流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南柯子/南歌子 其三 七夕","author":"陈三聘","text":"月傍云头吐，风将雨脚吹。\n夜深乌鹊向南飞。\n应是星娥颦恨、入双眉。\n旧怨垂千古，新欢只片时。\n一年屈指数佳期。\n到得佳期别了、又相思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其七","author":"陈三聘","text":"帘押低垂月影疏。\n梅枝和雪玉相扶。\n儿家春信入来无。\n半坠宝钗慵览镜，任偏罗髻却拈书。\n琴心谁与问相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"越浦潮来信息通。\n吴山不见暮云重。\n人生何事各西东。\n烟外好花红浅淡，雨馀芳草绿葱茏。\n苦无欢意敌春浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其三 新安驿席上留别","author":"陈三聘","text":"不怕春寒更出游。\n兰桡飞动却惊鸥。\n烟光佳处辄迟留。\n屏曲未曾歌醉梦，眉尖空只锁闲愁。\n从教丝柳绊行舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其五 元夕后三日王文明席上","author":"陈三聘","text":"点检尊前花柳丛。\n于中偏占牡丹风。\n等闲言语惯迎逢。\n扇影不摇珠的皪，钗梁斜亸玉玲珑。\n梦魂长向楚江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"翠幕遮笼锦一丛。\n尊前初见浅深红。\n淡云和月影葱茏。\n醉态只疑春睡里，啼妆愁听雨声中。\n更烧银烛醉东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其六","author":"陈三聘","text":"不跃银鞍与绣鞯。\n曲筇芒蹻见衰年。\n寻幽来立渡头船。\n碧涧芹羹珍下箸，红莲香饭乐归田。\n不妨尊酒兴悠然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其一 烛下海棠","author":"陈三聘","text":"酒力先从脸晕生。\n粉妆新丽笑相迎。\n晓寒高护彩云轻。\n不语似愁春力浅，有情应恨烛花明。\n更于何处觅倾城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"陈三聘","text":"风雨晚春天。\n芳兴慵悭。\n浅红稠绿满园间。\n独有梨花三四朵，留住春寒。\n年少跃金鞍。\n咫尺关山。\n倦飞如我已知还。\n洒向东风千点泪，衣上重看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦楼月/忆秦娥 其五","author":"陈三聘","text":"春膏集。\n新雷忽起龙蛇蛰。\n龙蛇蛰。\n柳塘风快，水流声急。\n伤心有泪凭谁浥。\n尊前容易青衫湿。\n青衫湿。\n渡头人去，野船鸥立。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦楼月/忆秦娥 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"光风薄。\n杨花欲谢春应觉。\n春应觉。\n一庭红叶，粉花吹落。\n冶游无复飞红索。\n凭高独上湖边阁。\n湖边阁。\n黄昏独倚，画阑西角。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦楼月/忆秦娥 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"云衣薄。\n春晴自有东风掠。\n东风掠。\n试听枝上，几声乾鹊。\n曲屏心事新题却。\n离愁何用堆眉角。\n堆眉角。\n今朝莫是，打头风恶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦楼月/忆秦娥 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"青楼缺。\n楼心人待黄昏月。\n黄昏月。\n入帘无奈，柳绵吹雪。\n谁人弄笛声呜咽。\n伤春未解丁香结。\n丁香结。\n鳞鸿何处，路遥江阔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦楼月/忆秦娥 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"花前狭。\n翠茵围坐花阴合。\n花阴合。\n闲情不似，一双狂蝶。\n春沟何处寻红叶。\n春寒料想罗衣怯。\n罗衣怯。\n午醺醒未，翠衾重叠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"先生困熟。\n万卷书中聊托宿。\n似怯清寒。\n更爇都梁向博山。\n游仙梦杳。\n啼鸟声中春又晓。\n未著乌纱。\n独坐溪亭数落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其五","author":"陈三聘","text":"殷勤举白。\n昨夜东风犹有雪。\n莫恨春迟。\n曾见梅花第一枝。\n阴晴未决。\n早晚清明新火活。\n梦绕秦楼。\n欲趁归潮上客舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"凝云不动。\n玉海无声千丈冻。\n来倚阑干。\n襟袖凭虚彻骨寒。\n归心易折。\n后夜月明应恨别。\n罨画图边。\n著我披蓑上钓船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"东篱黄菊。\n细捻香枝人事熟。\n少缓芳尊。\n且醉侬家曲米春。\n老人斋戒。\n底事新来移角带。\n归梦相关。\n明月松江万顷宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"盈盈袅袅。\n欲问卿卿还好好。\n无奈娇何。\n摺摺湘裙薄薄罗。\n尊前顾曲。\n舞作回风花拍促。\n压尽时流。\n棋里输伊一百筹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜分飞","author":"陈三聘","text":"莫唱骊驹容首聚。\n花径重来微步。\n从此朝天去。\n故山怨鹤栖猿侣。\n试卜西园春在否。\n无奈濛濛细雨。\n明日长亭路。\n断魂芳草人何处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦玉人引","author":"陈三聘","text":"别来何处，酒醒后，梦难觅。\n晚日溪亭，清晓便挂帆席。\n满载离愁，指去程、还作江南行客。\n目断层城，数迢迢山驿。\n素巾空染，泪痕斑、应是暗中滴。\n记得轻分，玉箫犹自凄咽。\n昨夜东风，梅柳惊春色。\n料伊也、没心情，过却好天良夕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦玉人引 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"倚阑干久，人不见，暮云碧。\n芳草池塘，春梦暗惊诗客。\n昨夜溪梅，向空山、雪里轻匀颜色。\n好赠行人，折枝南枝北。\n雨巾风帽，昔追游、谁念旧踪迹。\n料得疏篱，暗香时度风息。\n淡月微云，有何人消得。\n便归去、踏溪桥，慰我经年思忆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眼儿媚","author":"陈三聘","text":"酸。\n何人为我，丁宁驿使，来到江干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"筇枝探得梅开了。\n青鞋渐踏江头草。\n日日作东风。\n海棠相次红。\n离多良会少。\n此计应须早。\n莫待作行人。\n却将愁送春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其二 元夕立春","author":"陈三聘","text":"春城办得红蕖了。\n红蕖未点春先到。\n新月入新年。\n方才今夜圆。\n云屏谁为隔。\n肠断金钗客。\n好语写春幡。\n都教席上看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"杨花满院飞红索。\n春光不似人情薄。\n楼阁断霞明。\n梨花开晚晴。\n玉虬香散后。\n扶困三杯酒。\n不是听思归。\n归心思此时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其一 丙午立春大雪，是岁十二月九日丑时立春","author":"陈三聘","text":"朝来和气满西山。\n拄颊小阑干。\n柳色野塘幽兴，梅花纸帐轻寒。\n三杯淡酒，玉腴蔬嫩，青缕堆盘。\n细写池塘诗梦，玉人剪做春幡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其五","author":"陈三聘","text":"秋山横截半湖光。\n湖渚橘枝黄。\n纨扇罢摇蟾影，练衣已怯风凉。\n插红裂蟹，银丝鲙鲫，莫负传觞。\n醉里乾坤广大，人间宠辱兼忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"求田何处是生涯。\n双鬓已先华。\n随分夏凉冬暖，赏心秋月春花。\n吾年如此，愁来问酒，困后呼茶。\n结社竹林诗老，卜邻江上渔家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"草堂春过一分馀。\n幽事酒醒初。\n琴调细鸣焦木，矢声不断铜壶。\n关心药裹，忘年蓑笠，自著潜夫。\n雨后长镵东麓，月明短艇西湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"去年曾醉杏花坊。\n柳色间轻黄。\n重觅旧时行迹，春风满路梅香。\n平沙岸草，夫差故国，知是吾乡。\n梦断数声柔橹，只应已过横塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 其四","author":"陈三聘","text":"斜日熔金，三万顷、棹歌齐举。\n风不动、采苹双桨，翠鬟相语。\n月殿欲浮蟾兔魄，海神不放鱼龙舞。\n到今宵、秋气十分清，无今古。\n君试唤，扁舟侣。\n来伴我，潇湘渚。\n共夷犹春浪，笑歌秋浦。\n霸越独高身退后，尘缨未濯人谁许。\n叹酒杯、不到子陵台，刘伶土。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 其一 冬至","author":"陈三聘","text":"薄日轻云，天气好、相将祈谷。\n民情喜、颂声洋溢，清风斯穆。\n饮酒不多元有量，吟诗无数添新轴。\n对古人、一笑我真愚，君无俗。\n斜川路，经行熟。\n黄花在，归心足。\n问渊明去后，有谁能属。\n神武衣冠惊梦里，江湖渔钓论心曲。\n但从今、散发更披襟，谁能束。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 其三 雨后携家游西湖，荷花盛开","author":"陈三聘","text":"绀縠浮空，山拥髻、晚来风急。\n吹骤雨、藕花千柄，艳妆新浥。\n窥鉴粉光犹有泪，凌波罗袜何曾湿。\n讶汉宫、朝罢玉皇归，凝情立。\n尊前恨，歌三叠。\n身外事，轻飞叶。\n怅当年空系，誓江孤楫。\n云色远连平野尽，夕阳偏傍疏林入。\n看月明、冷浸碧琉璃，君须吸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"飞琼晓压梅枝重。\n酒面羊羔冻。\n谁将缟带逐车翻。\n明月秦楼昨夜、不胜寒。\n何须卷起重帘幕。\n愁怕春罗薄。\n玉杯持劝醉厌厌。\n无奈有人笼袖、出香尖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"天公意向人情满。\n灯月教同看。\n中秋虽是十分明。\n不比今宵处处、有华灯。\n艳桃秾李歌阑后。\n更醉青楼酒。\n不妨饮尽玉东西。\n横笛声中春色、要君知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人 其一 寄人觅梅","author":"陈三聘","text":"融融睡觉东风息。\n行到溪亭侧。\n一枝梅玉似人人。\n索笑依然消瘦、不禁春。\n相逢试问情多少。\n应怪山翁老。\n翠罗高护结花邻。\n一任馀芳争学、捧心颦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人 其四 红木犀","author":"陈三聘","text":"乾红剪碎烦纤玉。\n相并黄金粟。\n汉宫素面说明妃。\n马上秋风应解、著燕支。\n黄昏小树堪愁绝。\n不比梅花月。\n满天风露透肌凉。\n插取双枝归去、是谁香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙 七夕","author":"陈三聘","text":"银潢仙仗，离多会少，朝暮世情休妒。\n夜深风露洒然秋，又莫是、轻分泪雨。\n云收雾散，漏残更尽，遥想双星情绪。\n凭谁批敕诉天公，待留住、今宵休去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝶恋花","author":"陈三聘","text":"阊阖城西山四面。\n鸭绿鳞鳞，轻拍横塘岸。\n一阵东风羊角转。\n望中已觉孤帆远。\n独恨寻芳来较晚。\n柘老桑稠，农务村村遍。\n山鸟劝酤官酒贱。\n炊烟深巷听缫茧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄/一斛珠 元夕","author":"陈三聘","text":"东风寒绝。\n江城待得花枝发。\n欲知此夜碧天阔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其一","author":"陈三聘","text":"酒晕从教上脸丹。\n春愁何事点眉山。\n都将别后深深意，且向尊前细细看。\n多少恨，说应难。\n粉巾空染泪斓斑。\n炉猊筝雁长闲却，明月楼心夜正寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其二","author":"陈三聘","text":"指剥春葱去采蘋。\n衣丝秋藕不沾尘。\n眼波明处偏宜笑，眉黛愁来也解颦。\n巫峡路，忆行云。\n几番曾梦曲江春。\n相逢细把银釭照，犹恐今宵梦似真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其四 雪梅","author":"陈三聘","text":"剪碎霜绡巧作团。\n玉纤特地破朝寒。\n疏花好向钗横见，瘦影难敲月堕看。\n将旧恨，入眉弯。\n不须多样缕金幡。\n当时千点东风泪，怪见妆成粉未乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其三","author":"陈三聘","text":"昨夜东风怒不成。\n晓来犹自扫残英。\n半酸梅子连枝重，无力杨花到地轻。\n情易感，涕先零。\n玉虬香冷更凄清。\n事如芳草绵绵远，恨比浮云冉冉生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日示大圆洪智","author":"陈与义","text":"自得休心法，悠然不赋诗。\n忽逢重九日，无奈菊花枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日宜春苑午憩幕中听大光诵朱迪功诗","author":"陈与义","text":"酒酣耳热不能歌，奈此一川黄菊何。\n卧听西风吹好句，老夫无恨幕生波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月八日戏作两绝句示妻子 其一","author":"陈与义","text":"今夕知何夕，都如未病时。\n重阳莫草草，剩作几篇诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月八日戏作两绝句示妻子 其二","author":"陈与义","text":"小瓮今朝熟，无劳问酒家。\n重阳明日是，何处有黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山二首 其二","author":"陈与义","text":"都迷去时景，策杖烟漫漫。\n微雨洗春色，诸峰生晚寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山二首 其一","author":"陈与义","text":"出山复入山，路随溪水转。\n东风不惜花，一暮都开遍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十三日再赋二首其一以赞使君是日对花赋此韵诗笔落纵横而郡中修水战之具方大阅于燕公楼下也其一自叙所感忆年十五在杭州始识此花皆三丈高木尝赋诗焉 其一","author":"陈与义","text":"我丈风流元祐枝，晴轩雨雹笔端迷。\n从容文武一时了，赋罢木犀观水犀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13802,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十三日再赋二首其一以赞使君是日对花赋此韵诗笔落纵横而郡中修水战之具方大阅于燕公楼下也其一自叙所感忆年十五在杭州始识此花皆三丈高木尝赋诗焉 其二","author":"陈与义","text":"武林曾识最高枝，百感重逢岁月迷。\n向日擘笺须彩凤，如今执楯要文犀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13803,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又登岳阳楼","author":"陈与义","text":"岳阳楼前丹叶飞，栏干留我不须归。\n洞庭镜面平千里，却要君山相发挥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13804,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与王子焕席大光同游廖园","author":"陈与义","text":"三枝筇竹兴还新，王丈席兄俱可人。\n侨立司州溪水上，吟诗把酒对青春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13805,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与夏致宏孙信道张巨山同集涧边以散发岩岫为韵赋四小诗 其一","author":"陈与义","text":"哦诗谷虚响，散发下岩半。\n披丛涧影摇，集鸟纷然散。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13806,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居二首 其二","author":"陈与义","text":"宅图不必烦丘令，已卜坡东涧水边。\n更与我为烧药灶，只愁君要买山钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":13807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]